          "heading": "Jake White eyes trusted Springbok ally for Fiji coaching team",
          "body": "Jake White is reportedly eyeing a trusted Springbok ally to join his Fiji coaching team, according to SA Rugby Magazine. White was appointed Fiji's head coach ahead of the 2027 Rugby World Cup, as Reuters reported in mid-October, but Fiji have yet to officially confirm his complete backroom staff, and the ally has not yet been named. Fiji's first matches under White are the Centennial Test against Japan and then November's Nations Championship games against France, Ireland and Italy, so the assistant picks will shape that block."
